flowchart TD

A[Analyst Starts Workflow]

A --> B{Input Type}

B -->|AID| C[Use AID]

B -->|Hostname| D[Lookup AID By Hostname]

C --> E[Set Generated AID]
D --> E

E --> F[Get Device Details]

F --> G{Windows Host?}

G --> H[Check If Collector Running]

H -->|Running| I[Send Already Running Email]

H -->|Not Running| J[Remove Existing Log File]

J --> K["Deploy & Run<br/>Rapid Forensics Collector"]

K --> L[Send Initial Notification]

L --> M[Initialize Collection Variables]

M --> N[Loop Every 3 Minutes]

N --> O{Collection Complete?}

O -->|No| N

O -->|Yes| P["Capture Upload Time<br/>Collection Time<br/>Log Path"]

P --> Q[Download Collector Log]

Q --> R[Remove Log File From Host]

R --> S[Request Analyst Approval]

S --> T{Delete ZIP File?}

T -->|Approve| U[Delete ZIP From Host]

T -->|Decline| V[Leave ZIP On Host]

T -->|Timeout| V